### Concrete Selectors & Assertions Summary

| Criterion | Target Element / Action | Concrete Selector / Hook Call | Target Assertion |
|---|---|---|---|
| **(1) Hit Target Strip** | `SplitEdgeDropZone` root | `getByTestId("pane-edge-drop-zone")` | `expect(el).toHaveClass("w-[20%]")` (20% boundary strip) |
| **(1) Drop Preview Overlay** | Dedicated preview element | `getByTestId("split-edge-drop-preview")` | `expect(el).toHaveClass("w-1/2")` (50% content overlay when `isOver: true`) |
| **(2) Webview Hide on Drag** | `TerminalSplitView` `onDragStart` | `setBrowserVisible(browserId, false)` | `expect(browserMocks.setBrowserVisible).toHaveBeenLastCalledWith("browser-id", false)` |
| **(2) Webview Restore on Drag End** | `TerminalSplitView` `onDragEnd` / `Cancel` | `setBrowserVisible(browserId, true)` | `expect(browserMocks.setBrowserVisible).toHaveBeenLastCalledWith("browser-id", true)` |
| **(3) Drop Payload Reached** | Real drop execution | `onMoveTabToSplit` callback | `expect(onMoveTabToSplit).toHaveBeenCalledWith(sourceTabId, groupId, "horizontal", "second", { tabId, leafId })` |
